decide('264364 264365','Likely covered','Istio config normalizes paths and Envoy/Node/nginx supply HTTP parsing rather than custom raw request parsing. Keep parser/version pins and targeted smuggling regression checks; absence of a runtime probe is not evidence that request parsing is absent.','core-accesslog app-web app-validation')
decide('264366','Needs N/A justification','Candidate nginx has no forward-proxy configuration and the UDS ingress is a reverse gateway; the official rule explicitly exempts deployments with no forward proxy.','app-web core-gateway','Record no-forward-proxy scope and retain the matching component architecture.',category='applicability')
decide('279028 278960','Likely covered','API validates JWT signature/issuer/audience/expiry and establishes tenant/user context; NATS identities and UDS mesh service identities cover process-level sources. This supports identification of data-transfer callers in the existing application path.','authz core-mtls')
decide('204712 278966','Likely covered','Current global authentication plus per-route permission enforcement consults the authorization model and fails closed if user/target/authorization resolution fails. Schema/route coverage checks constrain omitted metadata; preserve negative role/tenant tests for the release.','authz app-enforcer')
decide('204751 264349 204671','Likely covered','Bundled Keycloak explicitly uses PBKDF2-SHA512 with iterations; platform UDS realm uses PBKDF2-SHA256. These are salted password-KDF mechanisms rather than stored plaintext; validated crypto-module operation remains a separate requirement.','realm core-id-realm')
decide('204753 204657','Needs N/A justification','The selected bundled candidate has no configured LDAP/directory federation; external broker hostname is empty by default. The official directory-transport check is conditional. Reassess when a federation/broker is selected.','identity realm','Document no-directory-federation applicability for this candidate or assess the selected secure connection.',category='applicability')
decide('204757','Likely covered','The OIDC login path is delegated to Keycloak and does not return stored passwords or echo them in application responses; current log configuration redacts password/token/credential fields.','realm logging')
decide('204761 204765','Likely covered','Server-issued Keycloak/OIDC identifiers are used rather than accepting caller-chosen authenticated sessions. API verifies signed token properties and the browser uses standard OIDC/PKCE.','authz app-auth-service realm')
decide('204769','Likely covered','API authorization enforcement fails closed on missing identity or authorization resolution failure; deployment probes/readiness and UDS admission/mesh isolation prevent granting access because initialization failed.','app-enforcer authz app-pods core-policy')
decide('204773 204774 204775','Likely covered','Global HTTP error filter and shared NATS problem mapper turn unexpected/DB errors into generic 500 problem documents while logging bounded diagnostics on the server. Explicit domain errors still need ordinary application review, but missing error handling is not a supported finding.','app-error logging')
decide('204778 204779','Likely covered','Auth store wipes local state and calls OIDC signout; LoggedOutView displays an explicit logout message. This supports the UI/logout mechanism without claiming old access tokens are immediately revoked.','logout app-logged-out')
decide('204750','Needs work','Bundled realm has no 35-day account inactivity workflow, and the corresponding UDS capability is opt-in and disabled by default. Neither the candidate nor a default inheritance claim establishes automatic account disablement.','realm core-keycloak','Configure account inactivity disablement in the actual selected provider and preserve emergency-account exceptions.','account-lifecycle',category='configuration')
decide('204713 204714','Needs work','Bundled realm does not configure the UDS notice/consent theme or required acknowledgement action, and no management-console banner customization is supplied in the candidate. Using a separate UDS portal does not establish the bundled Keycloak admin banner.','realm identity','Add the required management notice and acknowledgement to the selected admin entry path, or document inherited enforcement at that exact path.','notice-banner',category='configuration')
decide('278964','Needs work','Falco detects and reports suspicious activity but does not automatically integrate its detections with access-control revocation/blocking. The official rule asks for that automated integration, so runtime detection alone is insufficient.','core-falco','Define the approved automated response/integration or obtain assessor tailoring; do not treat a dashboard alert as an access-control action.','runtime-response',category='integration/tailoring')

